		(property "Note" "H3a(b): port-VCC (+5V_SYS) entry bead position, 0R-DEFAULT (jumper); populate a real bead (same 0805 land) only on EMC evidence. Judgment call (beta splice 2026-07-03): the 24-pin's RJ-45 VCC is locked NC (spec 2.7 v3.3, no incoming 5VSB over the port), so the analogous 'port entry' for THIS module is the +5V_SYS OUTPUT crossing to the JST (J2) / mezzanine (J6) cable boundary -- the bead sits there, not on an incoming RJ-45 VCC pin. MPN matches eps-8pin's choice for platform consistency; C17477 read out-of-stock at verification (2026-07-03) -- any generic 0R 0805 jumper is a valid substitute, flag at BOM-freeze." (at 125.73 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
